   \[
   \frac{0.0077 \cdot 4.5}{0.05 \cdot 0.1 \cdot 0.007} = 0.0077 \cdot 450 / 5 \cdot 0.007 = 0.077 \cdot 90 / 0.007 = 77 \cdot 90 / 7 = 11 \cdot 90 = 990
   \]

