   \]

The first point of divergence is in the simplification of the denominator. The reference solution simplifies \(0.05 \cdot 0.1 \cdot 0.007\) to \(0.000035\), but the student did not perform this simplification correctly. Instead, the student seems to have simplified it to \(0.00035\) (which is incorrect).

### Conclusion
