train:36047:s4,train,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,The student has a conceptual gap in understanding how to calculate the profit percentage.,eos,False,False,"The concept of calculating profit percentage is incorrect. When calculating profit, the cost should be used as the base, not the selling price.","### Analysis
