train:14979:s5,train,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,Final verdict: concept gap,eos,True,True,"The calculation of the interest rate is incorrect. The interest rate of 12% over 5 years is 60%, so 60% of the sum is 4016.25. The sum is 4016.25/60% = 6639.75.","### Analysis
