train:35042:s2,train,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,the error is due to a wrong or missing mathematical concept.,eos,True,False,"When the quantities represented by Rs. 35 and Rs. 25 are different, they cannot be directly used to calculate the profit. First, find the least common multiple of the two quantities to make the number of items consistent, and then calculate the profit.","### Analysis
