     - Combined work done by Ram and Krish in 1 day = \( \frac{1}{18} + \frac{1}{9} = \frac{1}{18} + \frac{2}{18} = \frac{3}{18} = \frac{1}{6} \) of the task.
     - Total time needed = \( \frac{1}{\frac{1}{6}} = 6 \) days.

