     \]
     \[
     11b = 19c \implies b = \frac{19}{11}c
     \]
   - Then it finds \(d\):
     \[
     d = 15(b - c) = 15 \left( \frac{19}{11}c - c \right) = 15 \left( \frac{8}{11}c \right) = \frac{120}{11}c
     \]
   - Finally, the interval between buses is:
     \[
