val:1942:s1,val,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,This indicates a misunderstanding of how to apply the given ratios to find the number of left-handed women.,eos,False,True,"Since the number of right-handed men is maximized, we cannot directly calculate the ratio based on the original proportions. We should first calculate the number of left-handed men after subtracting all the right-handed people, and then calculate the ratio.","### Analysis
