val:36233:s4,val,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,slip,the student divided the profit by the selling price instead of the cost price.,eos,True,False,"The concept of calculating the profit margin is incorrect. When calculating profit, the cost should be used as the benchmark, not the selling price.","### Analysis

