Final verdict: concept gap"
val:13536:s5,val,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,Final verdict: concept gap,eos,True,False,"The teacher suggests that the student has made an error in calculating Arun's speed. Since Arun alone can complete the work in 70 days, his speed is 1/70, not 1/10 - 1/70. The correct calculation should be (3/5) / (1/70) = 42.","### Analysis
