val:36434:s5,val,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,Final verdict: concept gap,eos,False,False,"Since the number of right-handed men needs to be maximized, all men should be considered right-handed. Therefore, out of the 15 right-handed people, 12 are men and 3 are women. The remaining women are all left-handed, which is 5 people. Thus, the percentage of left-handed women is 5/20 = 25%.","### Analysis
