val:12916:s5,val,slip,Arithmetical error,concept_gap,"The student made a conceptual error in converting the speed from km/h to m/s, which led to using the wrong value in the final calculation.",eos,True,True,"The calculation is incorrect. The result of 280/(100/6) should be 16.8, not 10.8.","### Analysis
