val:16121:s6,val,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,Final verdict: concept gap,eos,True,False,"The problem assumes that the amount of bacteria present increased by the same fraction during each of the two 3 - hour periods. This is not true, since 12.4/x=x/8=>x^2=8*12.4=>x=10.","### Analysis
