test:14179:s5,test,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,this is a significant conceptual error.,eos,True,True,"The dividend calculation is incorrect. First, calculate the number of shares: (14400 / 120) = 120. Then, calculate the face value: Rs. (100 x 120) = Rs. 12000. Finally, calculate the dividend income: Rs. (7 / 100 x 12000) = Rs. 840.","### Analysis
