test:2638:s1,test,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,This indicates a conceptual misunderstanding rather than a simple arithmetic error.,eos,True,False,"Peter can finish the remaining half of the work in 10 days, so he can finish the whole work alone in 10 * 2 = 20 days.","### Analysis
