test:9012:s3,test,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,This indicates a conceptual misunderstanding rather than a simple arithmetic mistake.,eos,True,False,"The equation assumes that the average score is incorrect. When the average score is 90, the student forgot to deduct the five people with an average score of 40, resulting in an error. The correct equation should be 80x - 40 * 5 = 90(x - 5).","### Analysis
