test:15174:s5,test,concept_gap,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,concept_gap,the student did not understand how to calculate the percentage error in the context of the given problem.,eos,False,False,"To calculate the percentage of error, first calculate the error (9x - x / 9) = 80x / 9. Then calculate the percentage to get the answer ((80x / 9) / 9x) * 100 = 98.765%.","### Analysis
